          "kicker": "Coaching search",
          "heading": "Jake White emerges as leading candidate for vacant Fiji head coach position",
          "body": "Jake White has emerged as the leading candidate to take over as Fiji head coach following the departure of Mick Byrne. Fiji Rugby parted ways with Byrne by mutual agreement, with Chief Executive Koli Sewabu confirming the union's commitment to setting a new direction for the national team. Sitting 12th in the Nations Championship table after three defeats, Fiji are seeking established leadership to guide the squad towards the next World Cup."
