          "kicker": "Training insight",
          "heading": "Victor Wembanyama credits French rugby team for inspiring unity and camaraderie",
          "body": "NBA superstar Victor Wembanyama has praised the team culture at Provence Rugby following a recent off-season training stint with the club. The 22-year-old participated in line-out drills and physical conditioning alongside the squad, highlighting the unique bond between teammates and coaches. Wembanyama, who previously sought strength training with Shaolin monks, stated he was particularly moved by the professional welcome he received. Provence, currently competing in the second tier, have enjoyed a strong start to their domestic season."
