          "kicker": "URC match report",
          "heading": "Connacht fall to Glasgow defeat as Warriors dominate the set-piece",
          "body": "Connacht suffered a 36-19 defeat against Glasgow in Friday’s URC fixture at Scotstoun. The visitors struggled to contain the hosts' physical approach, as four of Glasgow's five tries were scored directly from mauls. Despite a bright start and a brace of tries from Josh Ioane, Connacht were unable to maintain momentum while battling against the set-piece pressure. The result leaves Connacht looking for improvements after failing to secure an away win at the venue since 2010."
