          "heading": "Italy maintains high-water mark for best-ever international world ranking position",
          "body": "Italy reached its highest-ever world ranking of No. 8 on two occasions in its history, achieving the feat first in 2007 and repeating it in 2024. The side currently sits 11th on the tournament log after three rounds, having recorded three losses and a points difference of -94. Following a 10-57 defeat against Australia, the Azzurri will aim to improve their standing in the upcoming fixture against South Africa."
