          "heading": "Australia slide in world rankings after heavy Eden Park Test defeat",
          "body": "The Wallabies have maintained their sixth-place position in the World Rugby rankings following their 50-19 loss to New Zealand on Saturday. Australia’s rating dropped from 85.55 to 84.89, leaving them just 0.11 points ahead of seventh-placed Scotland. A victory by more than 15 points would have elevated the side to fourth—their highest position since November 2021—but the heavy defeat at Eden Park has instead left the squad facing a precarious slide down the table ahead of next weekend."
