          "heading": "Japan Sakura XV return home to refocus ahead of Wales test",
          "body": "The Japan Sakura XV are set to return home winless after falling to a 19-43 defeat against Ireland in Cork. Despite a period of dominance in the opening minutes—capped by a Sakurako Korai try from a rolling maul—the team struggled to maintain momentum against a potent Irish kicking game. The squad now heads home to prepare for the upcoming Round 4 fixture against Wales, looking to rectify the set-piece and tactical inconsistencies that defined their recent European tour."
